WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.769
Group chat messages about shared bills give way to: Who owes whom?

00:02.769 --> 00:06.112
The SplitFree logo appears. Split expenses. Keep it yours.

00:06.112 --> 00:09.000
A phone shows the app's groups and balances. Your groups. One place.

00:09.000 --> 00:14.000
An expense of 1,600 rupees is entered. Equal, exact, percent, and shares split options appear.

00:14.000 --> 00:18.000
The expense is saved locally. Group balances update, showing who owes whom.

00:18.000 --> 00:23.000
A payment made outside the app is recorded. The balance updates.

00:23.000 --> 00:27.692
Two nearby phones exchange encrypted updates. No internet? No problem.

00:27.692 --> 00:32.308
No signup. No subscription. No developer-operated servers. No added tracking SDKs. Open source.

00:32.308 --> 00:36.934
SplitFree. Split expenses. Keep it yours. Free, open source, for Android.
